{
 "fps": 30,
 "durationInFrames": 16765,
 "seconds": 558.83,
 "cues": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.6,
   "end": 4.61,
   "startFrame": 18,
   "endFrame": 138,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "At six-oh-two in the morning my phone made a sound I had never heard before."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 4.96,
   "end": 6.197,
   "startFrame": 149,
   "endFrame": 186,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Not a ringtone."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 6.547,
   "end": 7.562,
   "startFrame": 196,
   "endFrame": 227,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "An alarm."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 8.462,
   "end": 10.767,
   "startFrame": 254,
   "endFrame": 323,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "The screen said: emergency alert."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 11.117,
   "end": 12.353,
   "startFrame": 334,
   "endFrame": 371,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Remain calm."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 12.703,
   "end": 14.956,
   "startFrame": 381,
   "endFrame": 449,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Next update in twenty-four hours."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 15.856,
   "end": 17.731,
   "startFrame": 476,
   "endFrame": 532,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I read the last line twice."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 18.081,
   "end": 19.526,
   "startFrame": 542,
   "endFrame": 586,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Twenty-four hours."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 19.876,
   "end": 23.469,
   "startFrame": 596,
   "endFrame": 704,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "Whoever wrote it did not think I would need to know anything sooner."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 24.369,
   "end": 25.853,
   "startFrame": 731,
   "endFrame": 776,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I walked to the window."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 26.203,
   "end": 30.5,
   "startFrame": 786,
   "endFrame": 915,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "Down on the street, a man ran past a stopped car with his shoes in his hand."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 30.85,
   "end": 32.816,
   "startFrame": 926,
   "endFrame": 984,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "A woman was screaming a name."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 33.166,
   "end": 37.033,
   "startFrame": 995,
   "endFrame": 1111,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "Someone was leaning on a horn, and nobody was telling him to stop."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 37.383,
   "end": 43.984,
   "startFrame": 1121,
   "endFrame": 1320,
   "words": 25,
   "text": "At the far end of the block, a few people were walking toward the crowd, slowly, in a way that made the crowd run faster."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 44.884,
   "end": 47.371,
   "startFrame": 1347,
   "endFrame": 1421,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I did not understand what I was looking at."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 47.721,
   "end": 50.299,
   "startFrame": 1432,
   "endFrame": 1509,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I only understood that I could not stay here."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 50.649,
   "end": 52.576,
   "startFrame": 1519,
   "endFrame": 1577,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "The building was already loud."
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 52.926,
   "end": 55.738,
   "startFrame": 1588,
   "endFrame": 1672,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Doors, footsteps, voices in the stairwell."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 56.088,
   "end": 59.356,
   "startFrame": 1683,
   "endFrame": 1781,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "Noise, I would learn, is the one thing you cannot afford."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 60.256,
   "end": 61.571,
   "startFrame": 1808,
   "endFrame": 1847,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I packed fast."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 61.921,
   "end": 63.496,
   "startFrame": 1858,
   "endFrame": 1905,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Two bottles of water."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 63.846000000000004,
   "end": 65.213,
   "startFrame": 1915,
   "endFrame": 1956,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Two snack bars."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 65.563,
   "end": 66.735,
   "startFrame": 1967,
   "endFrame": 2002,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "My flashlight."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 67.085,
   "end": 69.272,
   "startFrame": 2013,
   "endFrame": 2078,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "My phone, at eighty-five percent."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 69.622,
   "end": 74.518,
   "startFrame": 2089,
   "endFrame": 2236,
   "words": 20,
   "text": "I took the small backpack from the hook by the door, and I did not look back at the apartment."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 75.418,
   "end": 77.787,
   "startFrame": 2263,
   "endFrame": 2334,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "That was the first decision of the day."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 78.137,
   "end": 79.804,
   "startFrame": 2344,
   "endFrame": 2394,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "It was not a good one yet."
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 80.154,
   "end": 81.625,
   "startFrame": 2405,
   "endFrame": 2449,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "But it was a decision."
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 82.525,
   "end": 84.009,
   "startFrame": 2476,
   "endFrame": 2520,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "The clock had started."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 84.90899999999999,
   "end": 88.919,
   "startFrame": 2547,
   "endFrame": 2668,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "Everyone on the street was running the same way, so I ran the same way."
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 89.269,
   "end": 90.41499999999999,
   "startFrame": 2678,
   "endFrame": 2712,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Toward the mall."
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 91.315,
   "end": 94.557,
   "startFrame": 2739,
   "endFrame": 2837,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "It had big doors, bright lights, security guards."
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 94.907,
   "end": 97.524,
   "startFrame": 2847,
   "endFrame": 2926,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "It looked like the kind of place that would be safe."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 97.874,
   "end": 100.78999999999999,
   "startFrame": 2936,
   "endFrame": 3024,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "That is exactly why everybody was going there."
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 101.69,
   "end": 103.38300000000001,
   "startFrame": 3051,
   "endFrame": 3101,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "The entrance was a funnel."
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 103.733,
   "end": 107.977,
   "startFrame": 3112,
   "endFrame": 3239,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "Hundreds of people pushing through two doors, and the noise bouncing off the glass."
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 108.327,
   "end": 110.215,
   "startFrame": 3250,
   "endFrame": 3306,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I told myself it was fine."
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 110.565,
   "end": 111.98400000000001,
   "startFrame": 3317,
   "endFrame": 3360,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Crowds mean help."
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 112.334,
   "end": 114.404,
   "startFrame": 3370,
   "endFrame": 3432,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Crowds mean someone is in charge."
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 115.304,
   "end": 117.088,
   "startFrame": 3459,
   "endFrame": 3513,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Inside, it got worse."
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 117.438,
   "end": 120.979,
   "startFrame": 3523,
   "endFrame": 3629,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "A man shouted for everyone to stay calm, and nobody listened."
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 121.329,
   "end": 123.673,
   "startFrame": 3640,
   "endFrame": 3710,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "A child was crying somewhere above me."
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 124.023,
   "end": 128.098,
   "startFrame": 3721,
   "endFrame": 3843,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "I found a small kiosk with its shutter half open and took what I could carry."
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 128.448,
   "end": 130.023,
   "startFrame": 3853,
   "endFrame": 3901,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Two bottles of water."
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 130.373,
   "end": 131.91,
   "startFrame": 3911,
   "endFrame": 3957,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Three cans of food."
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 132.81,
   "end": 135.309,
   "startFrame": 3984,
   "endFrame": 4059,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I did not check how many exits there were."
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 135.659,
   "end": 137.964,
   "startFrame": 4070,
   "endFrame": 4139,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I did not look for a quiet corner."
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 138.314,
   "end": 140.189,
   "startFrame": 4149,
   "endFrame": 4206,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I did what everyone else did."
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 140.539,
   "end": 141.945,
   "startFrame": 4216,
   "endFrame": 4258,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I followed the noise."
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 142.845,
   "end": 144.433,
   "startFrame": 4285,
   "endFrame": 4333,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Here is what I got wrong."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 144.78300000000002,
   "end": 146.762,
   "startFrame": 4343,
   "endFrame": 4403,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I thought a crowd was protection."
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 147.112,
   "end": 148.661,
   "startFrame": 4413,
   "endFrame": 4460,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "A crowd is a signal."
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 149.011,
   "end": 154.102,
   "startFrame": 4470,
   "endFrame": 4623,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "Every shout, every alarm, every breaking glass door was telling them exactly where we were."
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 155.002,
   "end": 156.95499999999998,
   "startFrame": 4650,
   "endFrame": 4709,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "It started on the upper level."
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 157.305,
   "end": 158.607,
   "startFrame": 4719,
   "endFrame": 4758,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I never saw how."
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 158.957,
   "end": 165.05,
   "startFrame": 4769,
   "endFrame": 4952,
   "words": 23,
   "text": "First a scream, then a surge, and then the whole floor was moving at once toward the only place anyone could think of."
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 165.4,
   "end": 166.546,
   "startFrame": 4962,
   "endFrame": 4996,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "The stairwell."
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 167.446,
   "end": 168.761,
   "startFrame": 5023,
   "endFrame": 5063,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I got swept in."
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 169.111,
   "end": 172.197,
   "startFrame": 5073,
   "endFrame": 5166,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "The stairs were too narrow for the number of people on them."
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 172.547,
   "end": 176.84300000000002,
   "startFrame": 5176,
   "endFrame": 5305,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "Shoulders, elbows, bags, and a metal handrail running down the middle."
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 177.19299999999998,
   "end": 178.86,
   "startFrame": 5316,
   "endFrame": 5366,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "My backpack caught on it."
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 179.76,
   "end": 182.976,
   "startFrame": 5393,
   "endFrame": 5489,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "For a moment I did not understand why I had stopped moving."
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 183.326,
   "end": 187.245,
   "startFrame": 5500,
   "endFrame": 5617,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "The crowd kept pushing, and the strap held me to the railing like a hand."
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 187.595,
   "end": 188.883,
   "startFrame": 5628,
   "endFrame": 5666,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I pulled once."
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 189.233,
   "end": 190.054,
   "startFrame": 5677,
   "endFrame": 5702,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "Nothing."
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 190.404,
   "end": 192.343,
   "startFrame": 5712,
   "endFrame": 5770,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "People were shouting behind me."
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 192.693,
   "end": 194.02100000000002,
   "startFrame": 5781,
   "endFrame": 5821,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Someone fell."
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 194.371,
   "end": 197.9,
   "startFrame": 5831,
   "endFrame": 5937,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "Below us the sound changed, and I knew what it meant without looking."
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 198.8,
   "end": 203.904,
   "startFrame": 5964,
   "endFrame": 6117,
   "words": 20,
   "text": "I slipped one arm out of the strap, dragged the bag free, and tore my palm open on the metal."
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 204.254,
   "end": 205.256,
   "startFrame": 6128,
   "endFrame": 6158,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "It stung."
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 205.606,
   "end": 206.96,
   "startFrame": 6168,
   "endFrame": 6209,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I did not care."
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 207.86,
   "end": 211.27100000000002,
   "startFrame": 6236,
   "endFrame": 6338,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "At the next landing there was a grey door with three words on it."
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 211.621,
   "end": 212.832,
   "startFrame": 6349,
   "endFrame": 6385,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Staff only."
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 213.732,
   "end": 214.94299999999998,
   "startFrame": 6412,
   "endFrame": 6448,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "It was unlocked."
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 215.293,
   "end": 217.766,
   "startFrame": 6459,
   "endFrame": 6533,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I pushed through and pulled it shut behind me."
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 218.11599999999999,
   "end": 221.345,
   "startFrame": 6543,
   "endFrame": 6640,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "A corridor, cold air, the smell of cleaning fluid."
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 221.695,
   "end": 223.82999999999998,
   "startFrame": 6651,
   "endFrame": 6715,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Through the wall I could hear the mall."
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 224.18,
   "end": 230.43,
   "startFrame": 6725,
   "endFrame": 6913,
   "words": 24,
   "text": "I went the other way, down a ramp, through a second door, and out onto a loading dock where the morning was suddenly quiet."
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 231.32999999999998,
   "end": 235.497,
   "startFrame": 6940,
   "endFrame": 7065,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "I sat down between two dumpsters, and I realised my hand was shaking."
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 236.397,
   "end": 239.73,
   "startFrame": 7092,
   "endFrame": 7192,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "I did not know how long I could stay there, so I used the time."
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 240.08,
   "end": 245.626,
   "startFrame": 7202,
   "endFrame": 7369,
   "words": 21,
   "text": "I opened the notes on my phone and typed with one thumb, because my other hand was bleeding onto my sleeve."
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 246.526,
   "end": 247.529,
   "startFrame": 7396,
   "endFrame": 7426,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Rule one."
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 247.879,
   "end": 249.102,
   "startFrame": 7436,
   "endFrame": 7473,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Noise draws them."
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 249.452,
   "end": 250.533,
   "startFrame": 7484,
   "endFrame": 7516,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Be quiet."
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 251.433,
   "end": 252.513,
   "startFrame": 7543,
   "endFrame": 7575,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Rule two."
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 252.863,
   "end": 255.702,
   "startFrame": 7586,
   "endFrame": 7671,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "Never go into a place without a second way out."
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 256.602,
   "end": 257.747,
   "startFrame": 7698,
   "endFrame": 7732,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Rule three."
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 258.097,
   "end": 261.183,
   "startFrame": 7743,
   "endFrame": 7835,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "Do not stay anywhere you cannot leave in under a minute."
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 262.08299999999997,
   "end": 264.58299999999997,
   "startFrame": 7862,
   "endFrame": 7937,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Two percent of my battery for three lines."
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 264.933,
   "end": 266.157,
   "startFrame": 7948,
   "endFrame": 7985,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "It was worth it."
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 267.057,
   "end": 270.325,
   "startFrame": 8012,
   "endFrame": 8110,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "From behind the dumpster I could see a long stretch of street."
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 270.675,
   "end": 277.094,
   "startFrame": 8120,
   "endFrame": 8313,
   "words": 23,
   "text": "Somewhere in the mall an alarm was ringing and ringing, and the people left out here were drifting toward it, one after another."
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 277.444,
   "end": 278.746,
   "startFrame": 8323,
   "endFrame": 8362,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "They did not run."
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 279.096,
   "end": 280.68399999999997,
   "startFrame": 8373,
   "endFrame": 8421,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "They did not look for me."
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 281.034,
   "end": 284.224,
   "startFrame": 8431,
   "endFrame": 8527,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "They walked toward the sound the way water finds a low place."
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 285.124,
   "end": 287.324,
   "startFrame": 8554,
   "endFrame": 8620,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "That was when I understood the rest."
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 287.674,
   "end": 289.119,
   "startFrame": 8630,
   "endFrame": 8674,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "They were not fast."
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 289.469,
   "end": 290.901,
   "startFrame": 8684,
   "endFrame": 8727,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "They were not clever."
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 291.251,
   "end": 292.722,
   "startFrame": 8738,
   "endFrame": 8782,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "They followed the noise."
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 293.072,
   "end": 297.291,
   "startFrame": 8792,
   "endFrame": 8919,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "And if I could be quiet, and far enough away, they would not follow me at all."
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 298.19100000000003,
   "end": 300.769,
   "startFrame": 8946,
   "endFrame": 9023,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "By the afternoon I needed somewhere to rest."
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 301.119,
   "end": 305.298,
   "startFrame": 9034,
   "endFrame": 9159,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "The streets had gone quiet the way a place does when everyone has left in a hurry."
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 305.648,
   "end": 307.836,
   "startFrame": 9169,
   "endFrame": 9235,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "At the end of a row I found a house."
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 308.186,
   "end": 310.60699999999997,
   "startFrame": 9246,
   "endFrame": 9318,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "The front door stood open a hand's width."
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 310.957,
   "end": 311.999,
   "startFrame": 9329,
   "endFrame": 9360,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "No lights."
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 312.349,
   "end": 314.067,
   "startFrame": 9370,
   "endFrame": 9422,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "It looked like what I wanted."
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 314.417,
   "end": 315.25,
   "startFrame": 9433,
   "endFrame": 9458,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "A bed."
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 315.6,
   "end": 316.459,
   "startFrame": 9468,
   "endFrame": 9494,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "A lock."
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "start": 316.809,
   "end": 317.942,
   "startFrame": 9504,
   "endFrame": 9538,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "A back door."
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 318.842,
   "end": 320.326,
   "startFrame": 9565,
   "endFrame": 9610,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Then I saw the frame."
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 320.676,
   "end": 324.895,
   "startFrame": 9620,
   "endFrame": 9747,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "The wood around the lock was splintered, and the splinters pointed out, not in."
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "start": 325.245,
   "end": 327.575,
   "startFrame": 9757,
   "endFrame": 9827,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "Whatever broke that door had been inside."
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 328.475,
   "end": 330.402,
   "startFrame": 9854,
   "endFrame": 9912,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I stood there for a long time."
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 330.752,
   "end": 332.262,
   "startFrame": 9923,
   "endFrame": 9968,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Then the handle moved."
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 332.612,
   "end": 333.562,
   "startFrame": 9978,
   "endFrame": 10007,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "Slowly."
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 333.912,
   "end": 335.423,
   "startFrame": 10017,
   "endFrame": 10063,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Down, and back up."
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 335.773,
   "end": 337.556,
   "startFrame": 10073,
   "endFrame": 10127,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Nobody opened the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 338.456,
   "end": 342.636,
   "startFrame": 10154,
   "endFrame": 10279,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "Above me, in the upstairs window, a shadow crossed the glass and was gone."
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 343.536,
   "end": 344.851,
   "startFrame": 10306,
   "endFrame": 10346,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I did not run."
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 345.201,
   "end": 346.203,
   "startFrame": 10356,
   "endFrame": 10386,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Rule one."
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 346.553,
   "end": 353.597,
   "startFrame": 10397,
   "endFrame": 10608,
   "words": 28,
   "text": "I took one step back, then another, and I walked away with my hands tight on the straps of my backpack until the house was behind a hedge."
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 353.947,
   "end": 356.837,
   "startFrame": 10618,
   "endFrame": 10705,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "My heart was going so hard I thought it could be heard."
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 357.187,
   "end": 358.307,
   "startFrame": 10716,
   "endFrame": 10749,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "It could not."
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 359.207,
   "end": 363.217,
   "startFrame": 10776,
   "endFrame": 10897,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "That was the second decision of the day, and it was better than the first."
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 364.117,
   "end": 366.213,
   "startFrame": 10924,
   "endFrame": 10986,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "The light was already going orange."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 366.563,
   "end": 368.126,
   "startFrame": 10997,
   "endFrame": 11044,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I had maybe an hour."
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 368.476,
   "end": 371.561,
   "startFrame": 11054,
   "endFrame": 11147,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I made myself stop and think like the notes on my phone."
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 372.461,
   "end": 374.766,
   "startFrame": 11174,
   "endFrame": 11243,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "The first place was a parking garage."
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 375.116,
   "end": 377.85,
   "startFrame": 11253,
   "endFrame": 11336,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Open on every side, concrete, echoing."
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 378.2,
   "end": 379.71,
   "startFrame": 11346,
   "endFrame": 11391,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Too many entrances."
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 380.06,
   "end": 380.854,
   "startFrame": 11402,
   "endFrame": 11426,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 381.754,
   "end": 383.941,
   "startFrame": 11453,
   "endFrame": 11518,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "The second was an apartment block."
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 384.291,
   "end": 386.335,
   "startFrame": 11529,
   "endFrame": 11590,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Six floors, one stairwell."
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 386.685,
   "end": 389.459,
   "startFrame": 11601,
   "endFrame": 11684,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I had just spent the morning inside a stairwell."
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 389.809,
   "end": 390.603,
   "startFrame": 11694,
   "endFrame": 11718,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 391.503,
   "end": 395.109,
   "startFrame": 11745,
   "endFrame": 11853,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "The third was a small utility building behind a row of shops."
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 395.459,
   "end": 397.386,
   "startFrame": 11864,
   "endFrame": 11922,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "One steel door at the front."
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 397.736,
   "end": 399.754,
   "startFrame": 11932,
   "endFrame": 11993,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "A narrow service hatch at the back."
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 400.104,
   "end": 401.302,
   "startFrame": 12003,
   "endFrame": 12039,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "No windows."
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 401.652,
   "end": 403.93,
   "startFrame": 12050,
   "endFrame": 12118,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "It was cold, and it smelled of oil."
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 404.28,
   "end": 408.577,
   "startFrame": 12128,
   "endFrame": 12257,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "It had no water, no bed, nothing a normal person would call comfortable."
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 408.927,
   "end": 411.479,
   "startFrame": 12268,
   "endFrame": 12344,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "But it had two ways out, and it was quiet."
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 412.379,
   "end": 414.631,
   "startFrame": 12371,
   "endFrame": 12439,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I stood at the steel door and listened."
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 414.981,
   "end": 415.801,
   "startFrame": 12449,
   "endFrame": 12474,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "Nothing."
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 416.151,
   "end": 419.04200000000003,
   "startFrame": 12485,
   "endFrame": 12571,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I counted slowly to sixty and listened again."
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 419.392,
   "end": 420.212,
   "startFrame": 12582,
   "endFrame": 12606,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "Nothing."
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 421.112,
   "end": 425.33,
   "startFrame": 12633,
   "endFrame": 12760,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "Then I went in, and I closed the door as softly as I have ever closed anything."
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 426.23,
   "end": 427.623,
   "startFrame": 12787,
   "endFrame": 12829,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Night came fast."
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 427.973,
   "end": 431.059,
   "startFrame": 12839,
   "endFrame": 12932,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "With the power gone, the city went completely dark."
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 431.409,
   "end": 433.753,
   "startFrame": 12942,
   "endFrame": 13013,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I did not use the flashlight at first."
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 434.103,
   "end": 435.535,
   "startFrame": 13023,
   "endFrame": 13066,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Light draws them too."
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 435.885,
   "end": 440.585,
   "startFrame": 13077,
   "endFrame": 13218,
   "words": 20,
   "text": "I sat with my back to the wall opposite the door and the hatch at my shoulder, and I waited."
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 441.485,
   "end": 443.23,
   "startFrame": 13245,
   "endFrame": 13297,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Around midnight I heard it."
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 443.58,
   "end": 444.96,
   "startFrame": 13307,
   "endFrame": 13349,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "A scrape outside."
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 445.31,
   "end": 446.403,
   "startFrame": 13359,
   "endFrame": 13392,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Then another."
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 446.753,
   "end": 449.253,
   "startFrame": 13403,
   "endFrame": 13478,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Something dragging a foot across concrete."
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 450.153,
   "end": 455.218,
   "startFrame": 13505,
   "endFrame": 13657,
   "words": 18,
   "text": "I switched the flashlight on for ten seconds, only to see the room, and turned it off again."
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 455.568,
   "end": 457.807,
   "startFrame": 13667,
   "endFrame": 13734,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "In that moment the steel door moved."
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 458.157,
   "end": 459.251,
   "startFrame": 13745,
   "endFrame": 13778,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Not a knock."
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 459.601,
   "end": 460.564,
   "startFrame": 13788,
   "endFrame": 13817,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "A push."
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 460.914,
   "end": 461.773,
   "startFrame": 13827,
   "endFrame": 13853,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "Once."
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 462.123,
   "end": 462.93,
   "startFrame": 13864,
   "endFrame": 13888,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "Twice."
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 463.28,
   "end": 465.624,
   "startFrame": 13898,
   "endFrame": 13969,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Then a slow rhythm of hands on metal."
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 466.524,
   "end": 467.98199999999997,
   "startFrame": 13996,
   "endFrame": 14039,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "They could not open it."
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 468.332,
   "end": 469.855,
   "startFrame": 14050,
   "endFrame": 14096,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "They did not know how."
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 470.205,
   "end": 473.642,
   "startFrame": 14106,
   "endFrame": 14209,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "But they were there, and the door was not made to last forever."
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 474.54200000000003,
   "end": 476.287,
   "startFrame": 14236,
   "endFrame": 14289,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I crawled to the back hatch."
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 476.637,
   "end": 480.243,
   "startFrame": 14299,
   "endFrame": 14407,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "I held the lever with one hand and pressed the other over my own mouth."
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 480.593,
   "end": 483.171,
   "startFrame": 14418,
   "endFrame": 14495,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "The pushing went on for what felt like an hour."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 483.521,
   "end": 486.047,
   "startFrame": 14506,
   "endFrame": 14581,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "Then, little by little, it thinned out."
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 486.397,
   "end": 487.608,
   "startFrame": 14592,
   "endFrame": 14628,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "A last scrape."
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 487.958,
   "end": 489.064,
   "startFrame": 14639,
   "endFrame": 14672,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Then nothing."
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 489.414,
   "end": 491.042,
   "startFrame": 14682,
   "endFrame": 14731,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "They had lost the noise."
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 491.392,
   "end": 493.787,
   "startFrame": 14742,
   "endFrame": 14814,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "They had forgotten there was anything here."
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 494.687,
   "end": 496.002,
   "startFrame": 14841,
   "endFrame": 14880,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I did not leave."
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 496.352,
   "end": 499.112,
   "startFrame": 14891,
   "endFrame": 14973,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I stayed on my knees at the hatch until it was light."
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 500.012,
   "end": 502.356,
   "startFrame": 15000,
   "endFrame": 15071,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "That was the third decision of the day."
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 502.706,
   "end": 504.203,
   "startFrame": 15081,
   "endFrame": 15126,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "To do nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 505.103,
   "end": 506.691,
   "startFrame": 15153,
   "endFrame": 15201,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Dawn came grey and slow."
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 507.041,
   "end": 511.494,
   "startFrame": 15211,
   "endFrame": 15345,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "I opened the hatch a finger's width, looked at an empty yard, and closed it again."
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 511.844,
   "end": 514.383,
   "startFrame": 15355,
   "endFrame": 15431,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I had been awake for more than twenty hours."
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 514.733,
   "end": 521.504,
   "startFrame": 15442,
   "endFrame": 15645,
   "words": 24,
   "text": "I had a little over a litre of water, three meals of food, a scraped hand, a phone at sixty-two percent, and three rules."
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 522.404,
   "end": 523.653,
   "startFrame": 15672,
   "endFrame": 15710,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "My phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 524.003,
   "end": 525.162,
   "startFrame": 15720,
   "endFrame": 15755,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "A new message."
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 525.512,
   "end": 526.553,
   "startFrame": 15765,
   "endFrame": 15797,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "Automated."
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 526.903,
   "end": 527.776,
   "startFrame": 15807,
   "endFrame": 15833,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "Flat."
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 528.126,
   "end": 529.636,
   "startFrame": 15844,
   "endFrame": 15889,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Evacuation point."
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 529.986,
   "end": 532.355,
   "startFrame": 15900,
   "endFrame": 15971,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "River Crossing Bridge, north bank."
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 532.705,
   "end": 534.593,
   "startFrame": 15981,
   "endFrame": 16038,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Cut-off, twelve noon today."
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 535.493,
   "end": 537.042,
   "startFrame": 16065,
   "endFrame": 16111,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I read it four times."
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 537.392,
   "end": 539.436,
   "startFrame": 16122,
   "endFrame": 16183,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I should have asked who was sending it."
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 539.7860000000001,
   "end": 542.534,
   "startFrame": 16194,
   "endFrame": 16276,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I should have asked how many other people had read it."
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 542.884,
   "end": 545.488,
   "startFrame": 16287,
   "endFrame": 16365,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Instead I did what a tired person does."
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 545.838,
   "end": 547.491,
   "startFrame": 16375,
   "endFrame": 16425,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I wanted it to be true."
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 548.391,
   "end": 550.253,
   "startFrame": 16452,
   "endFrame": 16508,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I counted my supplies again."
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 550.603,
   "end": 551.996,
   "startFrame": 16518,
   "endFrame": 16560,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I checked the street."
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 552.346,
   "end": 557.332,
   "startFrame": 16570,
   "endFrame": 16720,
   "words": 18,
   "text": "I put the backpack on, I stepped out into the cold, and I started walking toward the river."
  }
 ],
 "chapters": []
}